"suggestion":"Establish a clear vertical reading order by anchoring the 'START' button as the primary call-to-action directly below the title, using increased scale or a more intense glow to make it the clear next step. Reduce the visual weight of the 'TRACK' and 'KEYS' panels by lowering their opacity or using a more subtle border, allowing them to recede into the background as secondary information. Remove the 'KEYS' panel entirely to eliminate redundancy, as the hit line already provides the necessary mapping. Integrate the note highway more tightly with the title by having the highway lines appear to emanate from the bottom of the text, creating a unified visual narrative that guides the eye from the game's identity down to the action."
}

